"We are given:\n\n- Anya has **4 times** as many erasers as Andrea.\n- Andrea has **4 erasers**.\n\n### Step 1: Find how many erasers Anya has.\n\nSince Anya has 4 times as many erasers as Andrea:\n\n$$\n\\text{Anya's erasers} = 4 \\times \\text{Andrea's erasers} = 4 \\times 4 = 16\n$$\n\n### Step 2: Find how many more erasers Anya has than Andrea.\n\n$$\n\\text{Difference} = \\text{Anya's erasers} - \\text{Andrea's erasers} = 16 - 4 = 12\n$$\n\n**Answer: 12**"
